'''Ghosty''' is a [[Pets|godly]] pet that was originally obtainable by purchasing the [[Ghostly Item Pack]] for 1,699 Robux during the [[Halloween Event 2019|2019 Halloween Event]].

==Appearance==
Ghosty appears to be a smiling teal ghost with big black eyes. It also has small pink blush on it beside its eyes. When floating around, it leaves a mini teal trail.

== Trivia ==

* This as well as [[Snowman Pet]], [[Santa Pet]] and [[Bunny (Pet)]] as of now cannot be traded. This is because of a glitch as they share the same name as other items in-game.
